              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan. 1.1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mu ndaalo che bubwami bwa Yehoyakimu, omwami Nebukadinesa owa Babiloni abotookhelesia Yuda. Ne khulwe kimiiko kitaru Yehoyakimu akholela Nebukadinesa. Enyuma we kimiiko kitaru akaluukhana aaba omureengu amuloba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aruma bipupu bie Bakalidayo, Bashamu, Bamoabu, ne Baamoni bonakake Yuda khuloondekhana ne elomo eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi niyo alomaloma khubirira khu bakholi bewe bang'oosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ali kano kakholekha khu Yuda khuloondekhana ne lilaka lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi lie khubarusia mumoni chewe sikila bumayaanu bwa Manase bwoosi nibwo akhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi kekholekha sikila sifuki sie babaandu bakhali ne kamabi tawe nisio Manase achukha. Manase achukha sifuki sikali mu Yerusalemu sie babaandu bakhaba ne kamabi tawe. Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi se anyala khubeela Yuda tawe, khuloondekhana nende niko Manase akhola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono bikholwa bibiindi bioosi bia Yehoyakimu ne koosi niko akhola biaandikwa mu sitabu sie chingano che babaami ba Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakimu afwa mala omusoleeli wewe Yehoyakini amiia mu bweyaangu bwewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Farao owa Misiri se echakho mu Yuda lundi tawe, sikila omwami owe Bababiloni aba abukuule bibiaba bioosi bia Farao owa Misiri khukhwama khu luuchi lwa Efurati khukhwola ebunaswa khu lwakha lwa Misiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omwami Yehoyakini owa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakini aba ne bukhulu bwe kimiiko ekhumi na munaane nga ne arakikha khukhwamiia Yuda. Amiia ne ali mu Yerusalemu khulwe kimieesi kitaru. Maayi wewe aba Nehushita, omukhaana owa Elinatani khukhwama Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhola bumayaanu ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi nga raraawe ne akhola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu siise sie bubwami bwewe, banamae ba Nebukadinesa omwami owa Babiloni, becha khukhupana ne lukoba lwa Yerusalemu mala balubotookhelesia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banamae bewe ne basilubotookhelesia, Nebukadinesa omwene echa Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.22.24+JER.22.25+JER.22.26+JER.22.27+JER.22.28+JER.22.29+JER.22.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer. 22.24-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.24.1+JER.24.2+JER.24.3+JER.24.4+JER.24.5+JER.24.6+JER.24.7+JER.24.8+JER.24.9+JER.24.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "24.1-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.29.1+JER.29.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "29.1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ne omwami Yehoyakini omwene alala ne maawe, basoleeli bewe, banamae bewe, ne banamae be lichipi beaana babeene khu mwami owa Babiloni. Nebukadinesa aamba Yehoyakini nga omuboe mu mwiiko kukhola munaane kwe bubwami bwa Nebukadinesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadinesa asuta bibiindu bie mu libiikhilo bioosi bie munju eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi nende bie mu libiikhilo lie mwichipi. Atonya bibiindu bie esahabu bioosi bie munju eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi nibio omwami Solomoni aba ne akhola. Kano koosi kekholekha nga Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne aloma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadinesa abukula babaandu be mu Yerusalemu boosi, babaandu be nju eye bubwami boosi ne babaandu be kamaani boosi nga baboe. Boosi alala baba babaandu chielefu ekhumi baboe. Lundi arusia mu sibala babaandu banabi alala ne baabasi, acha nabo alekha batambi bong'ene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
